---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在 - Afu的博客" description="你访问的页面不存在">
  <section class="not-found page-shell">
    <div class="not-found-copy">
      <p>404</p>
      <h1>页面走丢了</h1>
      <span>这个地址暂时没有对应内容，可以回到首页、查看归档，或直接搜索文章。</span>
      <div class="not-found-actions">
        <a href="/">返回首页</a>
        <a href="/archives">时间归档</a>
        <a href="/search">搜索文章</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
